    {
      "source": "Querydsl specific fragment for extending\n<a href=\"../support/SimpleReactiveNeo4jRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.neo4j.repository.support\"><code>SimpleReactiveNeo4jRepository</code></a>\nwith an implementation of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/querydsl/ReactiveQuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>ReactiveQuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a>. Provides the\nnecessary infrastructure for translating Query-DSL predicates into conditions that are\npassed along to the Cypher-DSL and eventually to the template infrastructure. This\nfragment will be loaded by the repository infrastructure when a repository is declared\nextending the above interface.",
      "translation": "用于扩展 <a href=\"../support/SimpleReactiveNeo4jRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.neo4j.repository.support\"><code>SimpleReactiveNeo4jRepository</code></a> 的 QueryDSL 特定片段，该片段实现了 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/querydsl/ReactiveQuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>ReactiveQuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a>。它提供了将 Query-DSL 谓词转换为传递给 Cypher-DSL 并最终传递给模板基础设施的条件所需的必要基础设施。当声明一个仓库扩展上述接口时，此片段将由仓库基础设施加载。",
      "count": 1
    },
